  "subject": "a couple renting a hundred-square-foot plot at a weekend leisure farm in Kam Tin for a year, where she does the watering and he picks off the caterpillars and snails, and in August he leaves the first red tomato for her to pick",
  "caption": "Cantonese-language Ghanaian guitar-band highlife, 1970s Cape Coast style. Two clean electric guitars weaving bright interlocking palm-wine-style lines, a round melodic electric bass, congas and a steady gankogui bell pattern, a light trap kit with rim clicks, and a soft two-trumpet horn line answering between phrases. Warm, airy band recording with the guitars upfront and sweet. Male Cantonese lead with a warm, plain tenor voice, a female voice joining in close high harmony on the choruses. 104 BPM, G major. Warm, teasing and quietly devoted. No accordion, no Latin percussion, no banjo, no fiddle, no Afrobeats or amapiano drums, no synths, no autotune, no pop production.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n錦田嗰塊田 我哋租咗一年\n逢禮拜日 西鐵轉小巴 再行廿分鐘\n你頂草帽大到 我睇唔到你塊面\n我孭住包肥料 你揸住一包蕃茄種\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你話你淋水 我負責捉蟲\n我話好 咁我哋就分工\n\n[Chorus]\n你係淋水嗰個 我係捉蟲嗰個\n一人一隻手套 一人一條田基\n你淋到成塊田 變晒泥漿\n我都唔講 我淨係鍾意睇你淋\n\n[Verse]\n六月啲菜蟲 食到啲葉成個窿\n我一條一條夾走 放返落隔籬草叢\n你喺水喉度跳起 叫話有隻蝸牛\n其實係你淋得多 先引佢上嚟\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你話唔關我事 係佢自己嚟\n我話係係係 係佢自己嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n你係淋水嗰個 我係捉蟲嗰個\n一人一隻手套 一人一條田基\n蝸牛又返嚟 你又扮唔知\n我捉完一隻 又望多你一次\n\n[Verse]\n八月頭一棚蕃茄 青青黃黃\n得一粒係紅 細細粒掛喺最底\n你蹲低咗好耐 都唔捨得摘\n我話摘啦 嗰粒我一早留咗畀你\n\n[Bridge]\n明年張租約 我已經簽咗\n多加一行通菜 你話你鍾意食\n你淋水 我捉蟲 仲有好多個禮拜日\n\n[Chorus]\n你係淋水嗰個 我係捉蟲嗰個\n一人一隻手套 一人一條田基\n淋多少少 都冇所謂\n最紅嗰粒 年年都係你嘅\n\n[Outro]\n你淋水 我捉蟲",
